{"availability":"available","full":"better-isms/aevral-demo","name":"aevral-demo","description":"Synthetic demo service: open the PRs to see Aevral review each one for access-control security flaws. By Better ISMS.","category":"Developer tools","language":"TypeScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-09-25T13:36:53Z","updated":"2026-10-02T11:57:07Z","branch":"main","homepage":null,"topics":["appsec","authorization","code-review","demo","idor","pull-requests","security"],"demo":"https://aevral.com/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T19:06:37.657Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-16T19:06:37.657Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-16T19:06:37.657Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T13:00:40.505Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-10T21:03:14.964Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-16T19:06:37.657Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A tiny, deliberately synthetic web service used to show what Aevral does on a pull request.","Aevral is a GitHub App that reviews each pull request for access-control security: authorization bypass, IDOR, missing ownership checks, tenant isolation, and business-logic flaws. It posts an advisory Check plus inline comments pinned to the exact added lines, at most five findings per review, and never blocks a merge. On a public repository, a clean review posts one short note instead of staying silent."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/better-isms/aevral-demo/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"8acfff46707e79d1b9e7848ccd3be2f6bbf4bc3fde2441cd7dae778aa8beff2f","extractedAt":"2026-10-08T13:00:40.672Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T13:00:40.672Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A tiny, deliberately synthetic web service used to show what Aevral does on a pull request.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/better-isms/aevral-demo/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"8acfff46707e79d1b9e7848ccd3be2f6bbf4bc3fde24